WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.350
<i>My name is Hiiragi Seiichi. 
I'm a second-year in high school.</i>

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.560
<i>I ate some Fruit of Evolution 
in another world</i>

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.620
<i>and got an invincible, OP physique!</i>

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.610
<i>There was a huge battle with monsters 
that had suddenly appeared.</i>

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.410
<i>But thanks to everyone's perverse levels 
of strength, they were quickly defeated!</i>

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.610
<i>Or so we thought,</i>

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:26.170
<i>but there are still more enemies popping up?!</i>

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.720
<i>What on earth is happening 
to my life in another world?!</i>

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:36.970
There are so many of them!

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:42.980
And while I only occasionally caught glimpses 
of S-Rank monsters in the last horde...

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:47.570
Now they're swarming us with 
nothing but S-Rank monsters?

00:00:47.570 --> 00:00:48.980
Yes.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.780
You bastards!

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.500
These guys are strong!

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:15.360
This is bad.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:17.010
We're being pushed back now.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.010
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:25.450
<i>I could create a wide-range 
spell to defeat the monsters...</i>

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.310
<i>But a spell that's wide-range,</i>

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:31.810
<i>not indiscriminate, 
and defeats only the monsters?</i>

00:01:32.270 --> 00:01:34.790
<i>How am I supposed to...</i>

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.280
I know!

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.280
Seiichi-kun?

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.070
I've got it!

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:45.570
I know the ultimate spell to 
break through this all at once!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>The Fruit of Evolution:</b>

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:55.210
<b>\h\hBefore I Knew It,

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:21.150
<b>Before I Knew It, It's the Final Episode!?</b>

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.270
The ultimate spell, you say?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:21.670
<i>Envision it.</i>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.600
<i>A spell that attacks a 
wide range from overhead,</i>

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:29.260
<i>one that works as if it were God's judgment!</i>

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:37.020
Seiichi?

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.790
Judgment!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:57.130
H-Huh?

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.200
Seiichi-kun?

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:04.430
I'm so embarrassed!

00:04:04.430 --> 00:04:07.680
Why won't it activate?!

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.440
Eh? This is...

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.440
Now, let there be justice!

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.050
Huh?

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:27.830
<i>Skill: Magic Creation activated.</i>

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:32.330
<i>As a result, Seiichi Magic: 
Judgment has been created.</i>

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.960
Thank goodness. It's only hitting 
the enemies, like I envisioned.

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.470
This is a divine blessing!

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:49.720
Ecstasy!

00:04:49.720 --> 00:04:52.220
More! Give me more!

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:56.470
Let's see... Seiichi Magic: Judgment...

00:04:56.900 --> 00:04:59.320
A spell that calls the light of judgment down

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.910
upon all the user recognizes as harmful.

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:02.990
Harmful?

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.480
Harmful?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:08.240
More! Yes, more!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:10.090
Harmful, huh?

00:05:10.090 --> 00:05:11.350
Makes sense.

00:05:11.350 --> 00:05:12.240
Sorry.

00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:17.930
Is it over?

00:05:17.930 --> 00:05:21.970
He wiped out that many 
monsters in an instant?

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:23.710
That's my master!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.720
Everyone! We won!

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:32.080
What?!

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.570
What happened?!

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:38.050
You monsters! For the Demon Lord!

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.510
Judgment!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:50.240
S-Seiichi-kun, you...

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:53.070
Er, well...

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.610
<i>You leveled up.</i>

00:05:57.470 --> 00:05:59.000
No way!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.690
<i>You leveled up.</i>

00:06:00.690 --> 00:06:02.000
<i>You leveled up.</i>

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:04.270
<i>You level-level-level—</i>

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:10.800
<i>lev-lev-lev-lev-lev...</i>

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:06.380
Stop it!

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:10.140
Don't make me even less human!

00:06:10.800 --> 00:06:11.760
<i>leveled...</i>

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.340
Are you okay?

00:06:15.570 --> 00:06:18.280
<i>You have leveled up.</i>

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:19.520
It's polite now?

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:23.490
<i>Since you have acquired a 
great quantity of skills,</i>

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:30.610
<i>I have taken the liberty to combine the 
various categories of skills into new skills.</i>

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:34.370
I don't need more cheats!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.040
You're incredible, Seiichi!

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:40.620
Please continue to use your 
power to defend our nation!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:44.820
I'm going to go check on 
the damage to the walls.

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:47.300
Let's take another bath together later!

00:06:48.060 --> 00:06:49.330
Ranze-san...

00:06:50.630 --> 00:06:52.010
Seiichi!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.110
What's wrong? Are you okay?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:56.810
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.700
Hey, what was that magic you just used?

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.080
Your Status display is false, isn't it?

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.810
Well...

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:05.500
Seiichi-oniichan.

00:07:06.260 --> 00:07:08.070
What's up, Oliga-chan?

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:12.200
You promised. Pet my head?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.820
All right.

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.330
You did a good job.

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.580
Seiichi-kun...

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.580
Pet my head?

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:23.830
I-I'd rather not!

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:26.590
That's not what I meant! Seiichi-kun!

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.840
Huh?!

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:33.380
Would you come to my academy 
and become a teacher?!

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:35.600
Huh?

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:50.390
I just can't get used to those looks.

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:53.660
Jeez, isn't there anything 
we can do about this?

00:07:56.490 --> 00:07:58.980
Is that... Seto?

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.880
Uh...

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.260
How about it?!

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:09.510
Seiichi, a teacher?

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.760
Um... why would you want me?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.160
That spell you just used 
to wipe out those monsters

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.630
was your own original spell, wasn't it?!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:21.680
Such a powerful spell, yet so precise!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:26.020
It's well beyond even me, the Transcendent!

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.530
Beyond the Transcendent?

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.780
The Super Transcendent!

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:34.530
I have such a person right 
here before my eyes!

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.160
Could you please teach me
how to use such power?!

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:41.430
I-I understand what you're 
trying to say, Barna-san!

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:44.670
Then you'll come to my academy?!

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.590
I-I can't make that decision yet.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.160
Why not?!

00:08:49.160 --> 00:08:51.490
First off, I promised Louise that

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:55.930
I wouldn't leave the royal capital 
until the Valkyries returned.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:58.910
I see.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.430
Second, I...

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:04.790
I don't want to be apart 
from my friends over there.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.940
Then how about this?

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.940
Saria-kun can come as a student,

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:15.950
that adventurer can come as a fellow teacher,

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:15.950
It's study time.

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.050
that young lady who kicked the monsters away

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.270
Take that!

00:09:19.050 --> 00:09:21.820
can come as either a student 
or a martial arts coach,

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:27.210
and that young lady there 
can come as your assistant.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:32.480
If you're willing to do all that for us, 
then I'm not against it, but...

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:34.890
I'm totally okay with it!

00:09:34.890 --> 00:09:37.010
An academy sounds fun!

00:09:37.010 --> 00:09:39.200
I don't really mind, either.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:42.790
Wherever you are is where 
I belong, after all.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:45.600
I was always your knight!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.730
Wherever you go, I shall follow!

00:09:48.730 --> 00:09:53.230
Yeah! If Seiichi-oniichan and the rest 
of you are going, then I'm going, too!

00:09:53.230 --> 00:09:55.060
It's settled, then!

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:59.540
So we'll be departing after 
Louise returns. Is that all right?

00:09:59.540 --> 00:10:01.490
Yes, that's fine.

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:03.490
Yay!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.500
I guess I'll finally have a school life again.

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:09.080
Isn't this great?

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:14.000
<i>I'm sure it'll be fun with 
Saria and the others around.</i>

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:18.640
Master!

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:22.440
You're really taking me out 
to eat, just the two of us?!

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.280
Yeah.

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:26.070
We still have several days 
before Louise returns.

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:27.520
Yay!

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:32.340
<i>We had a few days before we would be 
departing for Barbador Magic Academy,</i>

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:36.280
<i>so I decided to spend them 
taking everyone on dates.</i>

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:41.780
<i>With everyone's consent, of course.</i>

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.890
S-Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:48.660
Nah, I hardly waited at—

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:56.420
<i>Wh-Who's that?</i>

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.920
Well, shall we go?

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:59.470
Y-Yeah.

00:11:21.690 --> 00:11:23.630
Now, today is...

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:25.450
Seiichi!

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.790
Let's go out together with Oliga-chan today!

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:31.960
Huh? Where's this coming from?

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:36.240
Well, I feel bad for Oliga-chan 
being left behind all the time.

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:38.710
So rather than just the two of us,

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:41.680
I'd like Oliga-chan to go out with us!

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:42.920
All right.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.720
Shall the three of us head out, then?

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:46.560
Yeah!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.670
It's fun going out with you, Saria-oneechan.

00:11:54.670 --> 00:11:56.730
Really? I'm glad!

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.730
Seiichi-oniichan.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:00.740
Hmm? What is it?

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:02.240
Hey...

00:12:09.070 --> 00:12:10.210
Pass!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.700
Hey, over here, over here!

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:15.330
Oliga-chan!

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.130
Hey! Now you've done it!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.760
That's good. Oliga-chan 
looks like she's having fun.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.510
That was too easy!

00:12:19.570 --> 00:12:20.570
Saria...

00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:23.510
A lot has happened, huh?

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:26.490
Yeah, a lot has happened.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.370
Thank you.

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:28.020
Huh?

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.000
Thank you for falling in 
love with someone like me.

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:34.270
I love you, too.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.520
You're welcome!

00:12:39.910 --> 00:12:44.030
Look! He made her cry!

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.780
Bad man!

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.030
Seiichi-oniichan! No!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.720
Wha— Th-This is different!

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:55.040
Come play with us!

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:58.060
All right! I won't go easy on you!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:02.050
I'm the one who should thank you, Seiichi.

00:13:02.050 --> 00:13:03.440
There!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.390
Wh-What's that?

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:09.050
It's so big.

00:13:12.340 --> 00:13:14.880
I think that's that one girl's...

00:13:17.090 --> 00:13:19.310
Thank you all for waiting patiently.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.570
We're now hosting the 
Charasty Painting Competition!

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:29.570
I'm looking forward to this.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.420
Now to introduce our judge.

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:36.580
Here we have the talented artist, 
Master Painter Leon Berger-sama!

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:40.110
Huh? I feel like I've heard 
the name "Berger" before.

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:46.080
I'm looking forward to all the great 
pieces you've poured your passion into.

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:52.310
Now we'd like to move on to the judging!

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:56.350
First, the talented artist who's handily 
won countless art competitions,

00:13:56.350 --> 00:13:58.780
Clay Berger!

00:14:00.490 --> 00:14:01.630
That's it!

00:14:01.630 --> 00:14:04.230
Clay said his last name was Berger, too.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:07.490
The title of my piece...

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.490
is "Art"!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.740
What is with that painting?

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:19.250
Seiichi, your friend can 
paint an amazing picture.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.630
Yeah! It's such a pretty sun!

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.430
It looks like a delicious apple to me!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:30.010
Lulune, you never change...

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:34.630
This piece was created with 
my feelings toward art!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:36.450
These passionate, blazing feelings...

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:40.020
They're just like the flames of a matchstick!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:42.790
<i>Wait, it's not a sun?!</i>

00:14:44.020 --> 00:14:47.160
Now it's time for the final contestant,

00:14:47.160 --> 00:14:48.780
May Cherry-san!

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:51.100
Please come forward.

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:58.290
May... She's walking with 
her arms and legs in sync.

00:14:58.290 --> 00:15:01.790
Th-Th-Th-This is my piece!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:02.910
Huh?

00:15:02.910 --> 00:15:04.130
Wow!

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:05.550
That's...

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:14.970
Wh-What a gallant figure.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:18.490
This is truly a hero that appears in legends.

00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:22.050
What a hot guy.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:29.340
Th-This painting is a depiction of 
the man who gave me the courage

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.070
to enter this competition.

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:34.480
It really is me.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.000
The title is "Hero."

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:42.200
Thanks to him, I learned how 
important it is to face challenges.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.830
He's my hero!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:47.340
My ears are burning.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.500
Thank you very much.

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:53.350
Now, let's proceed to the judging!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.100
Oh, Seiichi-san.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.880
Congratulations on winning first place.

00:15:59.880 --> 00:16:01.570
Thank you so much!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:04.090
I didn't really do anything, though.

00:16:04.090 --> 00:16:06.120
Um, Seiichi-san...

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:10.020
Moments ago, I got an offer from Leon-sama...

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:15.280
and I think I'm going to go study 
painting in the city of art, Amuria.

00:16:15.280 --> 00:16:18.040
Wow! That's an incredible offer!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:22.870
So I'll be bidding farewell to this city soon.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.030
I see. Well, I'll miss you.

00:16:26.030 --> 00:16:29.090
Once I'm done studying art in Amuria,

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:32.880
would you let me paint 
you as my first painting?

00:16:32.880 --> 00:16:35.890
I'd be happy to. 
Could I ask you to do that?

00:16:35.890 --> 00:16:38.660
Yes! It's a promise!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:39.810
May!

00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:43.140
Grandpa Leon's calling for you.

00:16:43.140 --> 00:16:45.760
Okay! I'm coming now!

00:16:45.760 --> 00:16:47.390
Well, take care!

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.490
You too, May.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.190
It's the Valkyries!

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.400
The Valkyries have returned!

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:03.590
Master!

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:07.170
Myself and the Valkyries have returned!

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:08.670
Welcome back.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:11.470
Hey! Seiichi-san!

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:14.170
Come on, now, that's bad manners.

00:17:15.410 --> 00:17:17.230
I heard from the messengers.

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:20.500
You'll be going to the 
academy with Barna-sama?

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:23.680
I wish I could go with you, too.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:27.460
You need to protect this country, Louise.

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:29.450
Come pay us a visit sometime, though!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.560
I will!

00:17:32.710 --> 00:17:34.760
<i>Hey, Kreis!</i>

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.550
<i>What are you looking so depressed over?</i>

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.970
Oh, it's you, Lester.

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:44.960
<i>The pig that's heaped failure 
upon failure has failed again?</i>

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:47.460
Angrea.

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:56.220
You delay my resurrection, 
my beloved apostles?

00:17:56.220 --> 00:17:58.640
My apologies!

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:02.020
Presently, the apostles scattered 
throughout the lands

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:06.980
are in the process of gathering the despair 
needed to sustain you, Demon Lord.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.480
Not enough!

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:17.110
Offer me more despair, death, 
misfortune, and chaos.

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:22.850
All such darkness shall become my blood 
and flesh, and bring about my return.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:26.750
Yes! All for the Demon Lord!

00:18:28.410 --> 00:18:34.150
We need even richer despair 
to resurrect the Great Devil.

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:36.760
Barbador Magic Academy.

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.650
What? The Magic Academy?

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:44.310
Children of royalty and aristocrats 
from around the world gather there.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:48.890
If we were to take the lives of 
children with such bright futures...

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:54.640
Sounds like we'd collect 
a huge load of despair!

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:57.150
Then let us go.

00:18:57.150 --> 00:19:00.530
With the full force of our Demon Lord Order!

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:11.420
Do you know Sei-chan?

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:12.970
Sei-chan?

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:16.170
Was he summoned to this world, too?

00:19:16.170 --> 00:19:17.690
Probably.

00:19:17.690 --> 00:19:20.090
There are a lot of people at our school,

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:23.810
so I thought maybe you'd seen him in passing.

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:25.800
Why are you looking for him?

00:19:25.800 --> 00:19:28.680
Sei-chan doesn't have many friends,

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:30.690
so I figure he's in trouble.

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:34.060
That, and he saved me long ago.

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:35.940
So I'm returning the favor!

00:19:37.950 --> 00:19:41.560
If you guys from the council 
happen to spot Sei-chan,

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:44.700
tell him Airin is looking for him.

00:19:45.090 --> 00:19:46.140
Airin?

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.540
Well, that's all!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:49.950
Hey, wait!

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:54.040
Sei-chan, huh?

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.850
You've all taken really good care of me.

00:20:06.080 --> 00:20:09.250
Stay well, even while 
you're over there, Seiichi.

00:20:09.250 --> 00:20:13.980
Master, I take pride in 
having you for a Master.

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.300
A teacher, huh?

00:20:15.300 --> 00:20:18.760
Well, you'll do fine, I'm sure.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.810
You're just saying things.

00:20:20.810 --> 00:20:23.740
You're the last one I want to hear that from!

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.220
Seiichi-kun!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:29.160
No matter what hardships you face ahead,

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.340
your muscles will never betray you!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.490
It'll all be fine.

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:38.880
Just turn all the pain into pleasure.

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.770
Seiichi-san, take care.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:44.260
You're welcome at the café anytime.

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.080
Be careful.

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:49.270
We'll always be waiting for your return.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.930
Thank you all!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.970
All right, I'm heading out now!

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.750
Bye!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.270
Take care, everyone!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:58.700
Goodbye!

00:20:58.700 --> 00:20:59.890
Come back again!

00:20:59.890 --> 00:21:01.280
We'll be waiting for you!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:04.550
New foods await me!

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.800
See you again soon!

00:21:03.800 --> 00:21:05.030
Later.

00:21:10.350 --> 00:21:13.650
<i>This was the first town I 
visited when I didn't know</i>

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.540
<i>left from right in this new world.</i>

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:19.110
<i>The days I spent there are 
still burned into my eyes.</i>

00:21:19.730 --> 00:21:24.500
<i>I never knew the world could be 
so vibrant and full of impact.</i>

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:29.550
I truly want to thank all of you.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.710
What are you saying after all this time?

00:21:31.710 --> 00:21:34.810
Honestly, thank you, Seiichi!

00:21:48.720 --> 00:21:49.970
Do you miss it?

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:50.740
Huh?

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:57.050
It was a pleasant city that gave 
even me a kind, warm welcome.

00:21:57.640 --> 00:21:59.250
Seiichi...

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:03.100
But it's not like I'm 
bidding farewell forever.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:07.510
I plan to show them I'm doing 
well after I've grown some more!

00:22:07.510 --> 00:22:08.800
Good.

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:11.800
We're almost at Barbador Magic Academy.

00:22:11.800 --> 00:22:13.760
I'm counting on you, Seiichi-kun!

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:15.230
Right!

00:22:17.170 --> 00:22:21.500
<i>I don't know what kind of 
school life awaits me,</i>

00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:22.770
<i>but as long as we're all together,</i>

00:22:23.420 --> 00:22:25.630
<i>we can overcome any hardship!</i>

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:33.030
Wh-Who are you?

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:35.290
You don't know of me?

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.220
Then I shall tell you!

00:22:37.220 --> 00:22:39.290
I am the hero of justice,

00:22:39.290 --> 00:22:41.790
Gargand of Certain Victory!

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:43.190
Remember that!

00:22:46.370 --> 00:22:48.550
Idiot, idiot.

00:22:48.930 --> 00:22:52.050
<i>There's yet another new weirdo...</i>

00:22:52.910 --> 00:22:57.460
<i>What's going to happen to 
my life in another world?!</i>

00:23:00.760 --> 00:23:02.620
Have no fear!

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:04.570
You're not one to talk!

