00:23:10.800 --> 00:23:14.160
Time for "Seiichi's Status for Today"!

00:23:14.160 --> 00:23:18.140
Hey, Saria, do we even need this 
segment in the final episode?

00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:19.050
Huh?

00:23:21.780 --> 00:23:25.360
Also, who is this guy that appeared 
in the final episode?!

00:23:25.360 --> 00:23:28.910
You'll just have to look 
forward to more next time!

00:23:28.910 --> 00:23:31.060
Huh?! There's going to be more?!

00:23:31.950 --> 00:23:33.810
Don't just laugh it off!

00:23:33.810 --> 00:23:36.190
You have to be clear about that stuff!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:40.370
Next time, I'm the main character!

00:23:40.370 --> 00:23:41.540
Seriously?!

00:23:42.650 --> 00:23:46.520
What's going to happen to 
my life in another world?!

00:23:46.520 --> 00:23:47.810
See you again!

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:50.250
<b>Fin!?</b>
